### 1. List devices
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/devices

### Reemplaza este UUID con el de GET /devices
@deviceId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 2. Normal scenario
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/demo/scenarios/normal/{{deviceId}}

### 3. Dashboard
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/dashboard/{{deviceId}}

### 4. Leak scenario
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/demo/scenarios/leak/{{deviceId}}

### 5. Active alerts
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/alerts?deviceId={{deviceId}}&status=ACTIVE

### 6. Close valve
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/valves/{{deviceId}}/commands
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "CLOSE"
}

### 7. Latest valve command
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/valves/{{deviceId}}/latest

### 8. Pest observation
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/pest-observations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceId": "{{deviceId}}",
  "pestCount": 7,
  "confidence": 0.87,
  "imageUrl": "https://example.com/agroleak/frame-001.jpg"
}
